{"ID":"20240513083343-kraghsy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083343-kraghsy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083343-kraghsy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111535-hcf4olh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111535-hcf4olh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111535-hcf4olh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:723,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:723\u0026#125;","title":"068","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513111535-hcf4olh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 805px;","id":"20240513111535-hcf4olh","updated":"20240515123757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"060-9 L, ML"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080421"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙側乳癌，左側已潰，移轉雙腋淋巴結腫熱痛，至今約三年多，未經西醫治療。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 月經4/19, 4/20來了一點"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→心臟仍不夠強"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 手溫額熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 睡不好，半夜醒來2,3次，不易回睡"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→仍需強心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 睡時無燥熱感"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 雙肩臂酸(因腋下腫塊，無法自然將雙臂放鬆)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 無痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 大便好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 雙足尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 體內無寒熱感"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 胃口好，下午3,4點較餓，半夜不餓，無噁心"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 有流汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. 腋下淋巴腫塊變軟"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13. 缺盆處有小結節，平滑、可動的"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14. 不渴"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15. 無吞嚥問題"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→少陰腎主喉，需注意勿令病進至此!"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16. 左乳排出的膿血減少了，較收口了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17. 可走路運動半小時了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稍數緩有力，現在脈比三月下旬緩下來了"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"掌及下臂溫，上臂及肩熱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陰陽稍和了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 同前"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n同4/16方去當歸"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己五錢  茯苓五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→入三焦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蠣一兩  瓦楞子五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→軟堅散結"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮五錢  炮附子五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→排膿湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→苦味入心，補心陰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→發陽白芍五錢→入肝活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒麥芽五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→退乳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"薏仁五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→走皮表去左乳破饋傷口之濕；不用赤小豆去濕，因其偏走肛門，且欲令藥簡力專故。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢  丹皮三錢  紫根三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草三錢  炙鱉甲三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→入肝活血化瘀，預防癌移轉肝，肝、肺癌常用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽起石三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→起陽並軟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堅生附子三錢(另包)  乾薑三錢  炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四逆湯，病人手足冷、脈小無力，故用之壯心陽，心陽足則陽可入陰，亦可令月經來(奶水排出)                                   "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、此次處方同4/16方，去掉當歸；因當歸可補血、增加體力，卻也會使奶水產生，且欲令藥簡力專，故去之。若去當歸後，月經仍能來就更好!"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、對此女最有利的季節是夏天，因她病在心臟，夏天為心旺之時。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}